{
  "sn11.3:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 11.3 ",
  "sn11.3:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn11.3:0.3": "Dhajaggasutta ",
  "sn11.3:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ. ",
  "sn11.3:1.2": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.3:1.3": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "sn11.3:1.4": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn11.3:1.5": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.3:2.1": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, devāsurasaṅgāmo samupabyūḷho ahosi. ",
  "sn11.3:2.2": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo deve tāvatiṁse āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.3:3.1": "‘Sace, mārisā, devānaṁ saṅgāmagatānaṁ uppajjeyya bhayaṁ vā chambhitattaṁ vā lomahaṁso vā, mameva tasmiṁ samaye dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha. ",
  "sn11.3:3.2": "Mamañhi vo dhajaggaṁ ullokayataṁ yaṁ bhavissati bhayaṁ vā chambhitattaṁ vā lomahaṁso vā, so pahīyissati. ",
  "sn11.3:4.1": "No ce me dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha, atha pajāpatissa devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha. ",
  "sn11.3:4.2": "Pajāpatissa hi vo devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokayataṁ yaṁ bhavissati bhayaṁ vā chambhitattaṁ vā lomahaṁso vā, so pahīyissati. ",
  "sn11.3:5.1": "No ce pajāpatissa devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha, atha varuṇassa devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha. ",
  "sn11.3:5.2": "Varuṇassa hi vo devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokayataṁ yaṁ bhavissati bhayaṁ vā chambhitattaṁ vā lomahaṁso vā, so pahīyissati. ",
  "sn11.3:6.1": "No ce varuṇassa devarājassa dhajaggaṁ ullokeyyātha, atha īsānassa 